abel":"اكتشف Translation Flow","sourceType":"notification"},{"id":"5HVK3MiQelBTMqYffAIY9t","createdAt":"2026-06-04T22:34:12.599Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-04T22:34:12.599Z","title":"The ROI of AI-native translation","description":{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Nucleus Research found enterprise teams can cut localization spend by 80-90%, and compress timelines from weeks to hours — without the quality tradeoffs of generic AI.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"}],"nodeType":"document"},"publicationDate":"2026-06-05","link":"https://www.deepl.com/en/reports/nucleus-roi-study","linkLabel":"Read the findings","sourceType":"notification"},{"id":"blog-66YKFU5PLiw3kthXLnhjVc","createdAt":"2026-09-22T03:23:18.386Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-22T03:23:18.386Z","title":"What MCP changes about enterprise software","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Discover how the Model Context Protocol (MCP) shifts enterprise software from generalist reasoning to specialist capability. Explore expert insights on maintaining compliance, scaling AI agents, and integrating domain-specific AI into your workflow.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-09-22T00:00-05:00","link":"/ar/blog/what-mcp-changes-about-enterprise-software","sourceType":"blog"},{"id":"blog-5g1BOvx4UriGh81tLNNg43","createdAt":"2026-09-22T03:17:26.011Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-22T03:17:26.011Z","title":"أصبح DeepL متاحًا الآن في Microsoft Copilot وChatGPT وClaude عبر MCP","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"قم بربط DeepL بـ Microsoft Copilot و ChatGPT و Claude والأدوات الأخرى المتوافقة لترجمة النصوص والمستندات مباشرةً باستخدام DeepL","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-09-22T04:00+02:00","link":"/ar/blog/deepl-available-in-microsoft-copilot-chatgpt-claude-mcp","sourceType":"blog"},{"id":"blog-1feRaDLVNBsP7Bw5dh8cu4","createdAt":"2026-09-15T05:37:47.445Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-15T05:37:47.445Z","title":"يحافظ DeepL Voice الآن على صوتك في الوقت الفعلي عبر اللغات المختلفة","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"تحافظ الترجمة الصوتية في الوقت الفعلي الآن على نبرة وصوت كل متحدث عبر اللغات المختلفة، من خلال تطبيق سطح المكتب الموحد لـ Zoom و Teams و Google Meet.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-09-15T08:00-04:00","link":"/ar/blog/deepl-voice-preserves-your-voice-across-languages","sourceType":"blog"},{"id":"ailabs-Tf75UAj5SWnfpt1e1rW0P","createdAt":"2026-08-20T04:23:43.350Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-20T04:23:43.350Z","title":"طبقة الصوت الفورية لثورة في الترجمة الصوتية","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"اكتشف كيف تجمع واجهة برمجة تطبيقات DeepL Voice بين بروتوكولات الصوت المخصصة ونماذج الترجمة الشاملة لتوفير صوت من لغة إلى لغة بزمن انتقال منخفض للغاية.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-08-20T04:23:43.350Z","link":"/ar/ai-labs/real-time-audio-layer-transforming-voice-translation","sourceType":"aiLabs"},{"id":"ailabs-6qUCT8Vrhyv2Mo6IOkG7vE","createdAt":"2026-07-20T23:56:07.154Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-20T23:56:07.154Z","title":"كيف نعمل على تطوير نظام تقييم الجودة للترجمة في DeepL","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"تعرف على كيفية قيام نماذج التقييم المستقلة باكتشاف أخطاء الترجمة الآلية، وتبسيط سير عمل المُراجِع، وزيادة الثقة في عملية التوطين باستخدام الذكاء الاصطناعي.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-07-20T23:56:07.154Z","link":"/ar/ai-labs/building-translation-quality-evaluation","sourceType":"aiLabs"},{"id":"ailabs-7n9gJDN02FQEzeEXsQXmqA","createdAt":"2026-06-21T21:56:12.896Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-21T21:56:12.896Z","title":"من ترجمة النصوص عالية الجودة إلى منصة صوتية تعمل في الوقت الفعلي","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"اكتشف كيف تعمل نماذج تحويل الصوت إلى الكلام المباشرة على تقليل زمن الاستجابة والتقاط الفروق الدقيقة في الصوت، لتعرض ترجمة فورية تفوق الأدوات القياسية.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-06-21T21:56:12.896Z","link":"/ar/ai-labs/high-quality-text-to-real-time-voice","sourceType":"aiLabs"}],"cs":[{"id":"5OjIfi6FHdHGnmwy8XJEuC","createdAt":"2026-08-03T09:37:27.352Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-03T09:37:27.352Z","title":"DeepL pro agenty s AI","description":{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Nyní můžete DeepL používat přímo v Claude, ChatGPT, Microsoft Copilot a v jakémkoli agentovi kompatibilním s MCP. Vaši agenti tak mohou překládat způsobem, který odpovídá vaší společnosti: s vašimi pojmy, vaším tónem a vašimi standardy kvality.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Správci mohou přístup povolit nebo zakázat v nastavení organizace.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"}],"nodeType":"document"},"publicationDate":"2026-07-15","link":"https://www.deepl.com/cs/ai-agents","linkLabel":"Prozkoumejte DeepL pro AI agenty","relatedContent":[{"metadata":{"tags":[],"concepts":[]},"sys":{"space":{"sys":{"type":"Link","linkType":"Space","id":"pplyeawnfzc7"}},"id":"4dEWf3690LvxYVkZEHToqt","type":"Entry","createdAt":"2026-07-15T10:55:54.203Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-24T12:53:59.842Z","environment":{"sys":{"id":"master","type":"Link","linkType":"Environment"}},"publishedVersion":132,"revision":21,"contentType":{"sys":{"type":"Link","linkType":"ContentType","id":"landingPage"}},"locale":"cs"},"fields":{"title":"DeepL pro AI agenty: překládejte kdekoli, kde vaše AI pracuje","description":"Propojte DeepL s Claude, ChatGPT, Microsoft Copilot a jakýmkoli klientem MCP – překlady, psaní a terminologie vaší společnosti přímo ve vašich AI agentech.","urlPath":"ai-agents","urlPathVerification":"verified","publicationLocales":["ar","cs","de","en","es","fr","id","it","ja","ko","nl","pl","pt-BR","pt-PT","ru","sv","tr","uk","zh"],"dapPageId":1991,"pageOwner":"API","seoIndexation":true,"expandAllLinkCards":true,"header":[],"pageSections":[]}}],"sourceType":"notification"},{"id":"2TuRycS8zrSVTdPJh1MJX7","createdAt":"2026-07-07T12:00:16.677Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-08T15:21:02.536Z","title":"Translation Flow pro překlad v DeepL: Nové pracovní postupy založené na AI pro klíčové případy použití a integrace","description":{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Translation Flow přináší nové aktualizace a integrace pro klíčové případy použití, včetně Adobe Experience Manager a InDesign pro marketing; XLIFF pro vzdělávání a rozvoj; a SharePoint a Google Drive pro personální oddělení a další.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Zefektivněte vícejazyčné projekty pomocí komplexních pracovních postupů založených na AI a zpřístupněte Translation Flow ještě většímu počtu vašich funkčních týmů.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"}],"nodeType":"document"},"publicationDate":"2026-07-07","link":"https://www.deepl.com/cs/translation-flow","linkLabel":"Prozkoumejte Translation Flow","sourceType":"notification"},{"id":"5HVK3MiQelBTMqYffAIY9t","createdAt":"2026-06-04T22:34:12.599Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-04T22:34:12.599Z","title":"The ROI of AI-native translation","description":{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Nucleus Research found enterprise teams can cut localization spend by 80-90%, and compress timelines from weeks to hours — without the quality tradeoffs of generic AI.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"}],"nodeType":"document"},"publicationDate":"2026-06-05","link":"https://www.deepl.com/en/reports/nucleus-roi-study","linkLabel":"Read the findings","sourceType":"notification"},{"id":"blog-66YKFU5PLiw3kthXLnhjVc","createdAt":"2026-09-22T03:23:18.386Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-22T03:23:18.386Z","title":"What MCP changes about enterprise software","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Discover how the Model Context Protocol (MCP) shifts enterprise software from generalist reasoning to specialist capability. Explore expert insights on maintaining compliance, scaling AI agents, and integrating domain-specific AI into your workflow.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-09-22T00:00-05:00","link":"/cs/blog/what-mcp-changes-about-enterprise-software","sourceType":"blog"},{"id":"blog-5g1BOvx4UriGh81tLNNg43","createdAt":"2026-09-22T03:17:26.011Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-22T03:17:26.011Z","title":"DeepL je nyní k dispozici v aplikacích Microsoft Copilot, ChatGPT a Claude prostřednictvím MCP","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Propojte DeepL s Microsoft Copilot, ChatGPT, Claude a dalšími kompatibilními nástroji a přeložte texty a dokumenty přímo pomocí DeepL","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-09-22T04:00+02:00","link":"/cs/blog/deepl-available-in-microsoft-copilot-chatgpt-claude-mcp","sourceType":"blog"},{"id":"blog-1feRaDLVNBsP7Bw5dh8cu4","createdAt":"2026-09-15T05:37:47.445Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-15T05:37:47.445Z","title":"DeepL Voice nyní zachovává váš hlas v reálném čase napříč jazyky","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Překlad hlasu v reálném čase nyní zachovává tón a hlas každého mluvčího napříč jazyky, a to díky jednotné desktopové aplikaci pro Zoom, Teams a Google Meet.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-09-15T08:00-04:00","link":"/cs/blog/deepl-voice-preserves-your-voice-across-languages","sourceType":"blog"},{"id":"ailabs-Tf75UAj5SWnfpt1e1rW0P","createdAt":"2026-08-20T04:23:43.350Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-20T04:23:43.350Z","title":"Zvuková vrstva v reálném čase pro revoluci v hlasovém překladu","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"DeepL Voice API kombinuje zvukové protokoly a end-to-end modely pro překlad řeči s extrémně nízkou latencí.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-08-20T04:23:43.350Z","link":"/cs/ai-labs/real-time-audio-layer-transforming-voice-translation","sourceType":"aiLabs"},{"id":"ailabs-6qUCT8Vrhyv2Mo6IOkG7vE","createdAt":"2026-07-20T23:56:07.154Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-20T23:56:07.154Z","title":"Jak vyvíjíme systém posouzení kvality překladu pro DeepL","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Zjistěte, jak nezávislé modely detekují chyby strojového překladu, zefektivňují práci kontrolujících a zvyšují důvěru v lokalizaci pomocí AI.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-07-20T23:56:07.154Z","link":"/cs/ai-labs/building-translation-quality-evaluation","sourceType":"aiLabs"},{"id":"ailabs-7n9gJDN02FQEzeEXsQXmqA","createdAt":"2026-06-21T21:56:12.896Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-21T21:56:12.896Z","title":"Od kvalitního překladu po platformu pro hlasový překlad","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Modely přímé konverze zvuku na řeč minimalizují zpoždění a zachycují hlasové nuance, nabízejí překlad v reálném čase lepší než standardní nástroje.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-06-21T21:56:12.896Z","link":"/cs/ai-labs/high-quality-text-to-real-time-voice","sourceType":"aiLabs"}],"de":[{"id":"5OjIfi6FHdHGnmwy8XJEuC","createdAt":"2026-08-03T09:37:27.352Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-03T09:37:27.352Z","title":"DeepL für KI‑Agenten","description":{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Sie können DeepL jetzt direkt in Claude, ChatGPT, Microsoft Copilot und jedem MCP‑kompatiblen Agenten nutzen. So können Ihre Agenten genauso übersetzen wie Ihr Unternehmen: mit Ihren Begriffen, Ihrem Tonfall und Ihren Qualitätsstandards.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Administratoren können den Zugriff in den Unternehmenseinstellungen aktivieren oder deaktivieren.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"}],"nodeType":"document"},"publicationDate":"2026-07-15","link":"https://www.deepl.com/de/ai-agents","linkLabel":"Entdecken Sie DeepL für KI‑Agenten","relatedContent":[{"metadata":{"tags":[],"concepts":[]},"sys":{"space":{"sys":{"type":"Link","linkType":"Space","id":"pplyeawnfzc7"}},"id":"4dEWf3690LvxYVkZEHToqt","type":"Entry","createdAt":"2026-07-15T10:55:54.203Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-24T12:53:59.842Z","environment":{"sys":{"id":"master","type":"Link","linkType":"Environment"}},"publishedVersion":132,"revision":21,"contentType":{"sys":{"type":"Link","linkType":"ContentType","id":"landingPage"}},"locale":"de"},"fields":{"title":"DeepL für KI‑Agenten: Übersetzen Sie, wo Ihre KI arbeitet","description":"Verbinden Sie DeepL mit Claude, ChatGPT, Copilot und MCP‑Clients, und integrieren Sie Übersetzung, Textoptimierung und Unternehmensbegriffe in Ihre KI‑Agenten.","urlPath":"ai-agents","urlPathVerification":"verified","publicationLocales":["ar","cs","de","en","es","fr","id","it","ja","ko","nl","pl","pt-BR","pt-PT","ru","sv","tr","uk","zh"],"dapPageId":1991,"pageOwner":"API","seoIndexation":true,"expandAllLinkCards":true,"header":[],"pageSections":[]}}],"sourceType":"notification"},{"id":"2TuRycS8zrSVTdPJh1MJX7","createdAt":"2026-07-07T12:00:16.677Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-08T15:21:02.536Z","title":"DeepL Translation Flow: Neue KI-gestützte Workflows für die wichtigsten Anwendungsfälle und Integrationen","description":{"data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Translation Flow wurde um neue Funktionen und Integrationen für wichtige Anwendungsfälle erweitert, darunter Adobe Experience Manager und InDesign für das Marketing; XLIFF für den Bereich Lernen und Entwicklung (L&D); sowie SharePoint und Google Drive für das Personalwesen und weitere Fachbereiche."}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Optimieren Sie mehrsprachige Projekte mit durchgängigen, KI-gestützten Workflows und machen Sie Translation Flow für noch mehr Fachbereiche zugänglich."}]}],"nodeType":"document"},"publicationDate":"2026-07-07","link":"https://www.deepl.com/de/translation-flow","linkLabel":"Translation Flow entdecken","sourceType":"notification"},{"id":"5HVK3MiQelBTMqYffAIY9t","createdAt":"2026-06-04T22:34:12.599Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-04T22:34:12.599Z","title":"The ROI of AI-native translation","description":{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Nucleus Research found enterprise teams can cut localization spend by 80-90%, and compress timelines from weeks to hours — without the quality tradeoffs of generic AI.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"}],"nodeType":"document"},"publicationDate":"2026-06-05","link":"https://www.deepl.com/en/reports/nucleus-roi-study","linkLabel":"Read the findings","sourceType":"notification"},{"id":"blog-66YKFU5PLiw3kthXLnhjVc","createdAt":"2026-09-22T03:23:18.386Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-22T03:23:18.386Z","title":"What MCP changes about enterprise software","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Discover how the Model Context Protocol (MCP) shifts enterprise software from generalist reasoning to specialist capability. Explore expert insights on maintaining compliance, scaling AI agents, and integrating domain-specific AI into your workflow.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-09-22T00:00-05:00","link":"/de/blog/what-mcp-changes-about-enterprise-software","sourceType":"blog"},{"id":"blog-5g1BOvx4UriGh81tLNNg43","createdAt":"2026-09-22T03:17:26.011Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-22T03:17:26.011Z","title":"DeepL ist nun über MCP in Microsoft Copilot, ChatGPT und Claude verfügbar","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Verbinden Sie DeepL mit Microsoft Copilot, ChatGPT, Claude und anderen kompatiblen Tools, um Texte und Dokumente direkt mit DeepL zu übersetzen","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-09-22T04:00+02:00","link":"/de/blog/deepl-available-in-microsoft-copilot-chatgpt-claude-mcp","sourceType":"blog"},{"id":"blog-1feRaDLVNBsP7Bw5dh8cu4","createdAt":"2026-09-15T05:37:47.445Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-15T05:37:47.445Z","title":"DeepL Voice bewahrt nun Ihre Stimme in Echtzeit über alle Sprachen hinweg","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Die Sprachübersetzung in Echtzeit bewahrt nun den Tonfall und die Stimme jedes Sprechers sprachübergreifend – mit einer einheitlichen Desktop-App für Zoom, Teams und Google Meet.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-09-15T08:00-04:00","link":"/de/blog/deepl-voice-preserves-your-voice-across-languages","sourceType":"blog"},{"id":"ailabs-Tf75UAj5SWnfpt1e1rW0P","createdAt":"2026-08-20T04:23:43.350Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-20T04:23:43.350Z","title":"Die Echtzeit-Audioebene, die die Sprachübersetzung transformiert","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Erfahren Sie, wie die Voice API Audioprotokolle und End‑to‑End-Übersetzung kombiniert, um Speech‑to‑Speech-Audio mit ultraniedriger Latenz zu unterstützen.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-08-20T04:23:43.350Z","link":"/de/ai-labs/real-time-audio-layer-transforming-voice-translation","sourceType":"aiLabs"},{"id":"ailabs-6qUCT8Vrhyv2Mo6IOkG7vE","createdAt":"2026-07-20T23:56:07.154Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-20T23:56:07.154Z","title":"Aufbau der Übersetzungsqualitätsbewertung bei DeepL","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Wie unabhängige Bewertungsmodelle Fehler in maschinellen Übersetzungen erkennen, Prüfer-Workflows optimieren und Vertrauen in KI-Lokalisierung stärken.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-07-20T23:56:07.154Z","link":"/de/ai-labs/building-translation-quality-evaluation","sourceType":"aiLabs"},{"id":"ailabs-7n9gJDN02FQEzeEXsQXmqA","createdAt":"2026-06-21T21:56:12.896Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-21T21:56:12.896Z","title":"Von hochwertiger Textübersetzung zur Echtzeit-Sprachplattform","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Audio‑to‑Speech-Modelle minimieren die Latenz, erfassen stimmliche Nuancen und bieten eine Echtzeitübersetzung, die herkömmliche Tools bei Weitem übertrifft.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-06-21T21:56:12.896Z","link":"/de/ai-labs/high-quality-text-to-real-time-voice","sourceType":"aiLabs"}],"en":[{"id":"5OjIfi6FHdHGnmwy8XJEuC","createdAt":"2026-08-03T09:37:27.352Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-03T09:37:27.352Z","title":"DeepL for AI agents","description":{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Y","nodeType":"text"},{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"ou can now use DeepL right in Claude, ChatGPT, Microsoft Copilot, and any MCP-compatible agent. Now, your agents can","nodeType":"text"},{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":" translate the way your company does: your terms, your tone, your quality standards.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Admins can enable or disable access in organization settings.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"}],"nodeType":"document"},"publicationDate":"2026-07-15","link":"https://www.deepl.com/en/ai-agents","linkLabel":"Explore DeepL for AI agents","relatedContent":[{"metadata":{"tags":[],"concepts":[]},"sys":{"space":{"sys":{"type":"Link","linkType":"Space","id":"pplyeawnfzc7"}},"id":"4dEWf3690LvxYVkZEHToqt","type":"Entry","createdAt":"2026-07-15T10:55:54.203Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-24T12:53:59.842Z","environment":{"sys":{"id":"master","type":"Link","linkType":"Environment"}},"publishedVersion":132,"revision":21,"contentType":{"sys":{"type":"Link","linkType":"ContentType","id":"landingPage"}},"locale":"en"},"fields":{"title":"DeepL for AI agents: translate wherever your AI works","description":"Connect DeepL to Claude, ChatGPT, Microsoft Copilot and any MCP client — translation, writing and your company\'s terminology inside your AI agents.","urlPath":"ai-agents","urlPathVerification":"verified","publicationLocales":["ar","cs","de","en","es","fr","id","it","ja","ko","nl","pl","pt-BR","pt-PT","ru","sv","tr","uk","zh"],"dapPageId":1991,"pageOwner":"API","seoIndexation":true,"expandAllLinkCards":true,"header":[],"pageSections":[]}}],"sourceType":"notification"},{"id":"2TuRycS8zrSVTdPJh1MJX7","createdAt":"2026-07-07T12:00:16.677Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-08T15:21:02.536Z","title":"DeepL Translation Flow: New AI-powered workflows for key use cases and integrations","description":{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Translation Flow has added new updates and integrations to power key use cases, including Adobe Experience Manager and InDesign for Marketing; XLIFF for L&D; and SharePoint and Google Drive for HR and others.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Streamline multilingual projects with AI-first, end-to-end workflows, and make Translation Fl