le tools to translate text and documents directly with DeepL","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-09-22T04:00+02:00","link":"/en/blog/deepl-available-in-microsoft-copilot-chatgpt-claude-mcp","sourceType":"blog"},{"id":"blog-1feRaDLVNBsP7Bw5dh8cu4","createdAt":"2026-09-15T05:37:47.445Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-15T05:37:47.445Z","title":"DeepL Voice now preserves your voice in real time across languages","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Real-time voice translation now preserves each speaker\'s tone and voice across languages, with a unified desktop app for Zoom, Teams, and Google Meet.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-09-15T08:00-04:00","link":"/en/blog/deepl-voice-preserves-your-voice-across-languages","sourceType":"blog"},{"id":"ailabs-Tf75UAj5SWnfpt1e1rW0P","createdAt":"2026-08-20T04:23:43.350Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-20T04:23:43.350Z","title":"The real-time audio layer ready to transform voice translation","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Explore how DeepL Voice API combines custom audio protocols and end-to-end translation models to power ultra-low latency, speech-to-speech audio.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-08-20T04:23:43.350Z","link":"/en/ai-labs/real-time-audio-layer-transforming-voice-translation","sourceType":"aiLabs"},{"id":"ailabs-6qUCT8Vrhyv2Mo6IOkG7vE","createdAt":"2026-07-20T23:56:07.154Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-20T23:56:07.154Z","title":"How we’re building Translation Quality Evaluation for DeepL","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Learn how independent evaluation models detect machine translation errors, streamline reviewer workflows, and increase trust in AI localization.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-07-20T23:56:07.154Z","link":"/en/ai-labs/building-translation-quality-evaluation","sourceType":"aiLabs"},{"id":"ailabs-7n9gJDN02FQEzeEXsQXmqA","createdAt":"2026-06-21T21:56:12.896Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-21T21:56:12.896Z","title":"From high-quality text translation to a real-time voice platform","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Discover how direct audio-to-speech models minimize latency and capture vocal nuances, offering real-time translation that surpasses standard tools.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-06-21T21:56:12.896Z","link":"/en/ai-labs/high-quality-text-to-real-time-voice","sourceType":"aiLabs"}],"es":[{"id":"5OjIfi6FHdHGnmwy8XJEuC","createdAt":"2026-08-03T09:37:27.352Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-03T09:37:27.352Z","title":"DeepL para agentes de IA","description":{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Ahora puedes usar DeepL directamente en Claude, ChatGPT, Microsoft Copilot y cualquier agente compatible con MCP. Ahora, tus agentes pueden traducir tal y como lo hace tu empresa: con tus términos, tu tono y tus estándares de calidad.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Los administradores pueden activar o desactivar el acceso en la configuración de la organización.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"}],"nodeType":"document"},"publicationDate":"2026-07-15","link":"https://www.deepl.com/es/ai-agents","linkLabel":"Explora DeepL para agentes de IA","relatedContent":[{"metadata":{"tags":[],"concepts":[]},"sys":{"space":{"sys":{"type":"Link","linkType":"Space","id":"pplyeawnfzc7"}},"id":"4dEWf3690LvxYVkZEHToqt","type":"Entry","createdAt":"2026-07-15T10:55:54.203Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-24T12:53:59.842Z","environment":{"sys":{"id":"master","type":"Link","linkType":"Environment"}},"publishedVersion":132,"revision":21,"contentType":{"sys":{"type":"Li