d compress timelines from weeks to hours — without the quality tradeoffs of generic AI.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"}],"nodeType":"document"},"publicationDate":"2026-06-05","link":"https://www.deepl.com/en/reports/nucleus-roi-study","linkLabel":"Read the findings","sourceType":"notification"},{"id":"blog-66YKFU5PLiw3kthXLnhjVc","createdAt":"2026-09-22T03:23:18.386Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-22T03:23:18.386Z","title":"What MCP changes about enterprise software","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Discover how the Model Context Protocol (MCP) shifts enterprise software from generalist reasoning to specialist capability. Explore expert insights on maintaining compliance, scaling AI agents, and integrating domain-specific AI into your workflow.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-09-22T00:00-05:00","link":"/es/blog/what-mcp-changes-about-enterprise-software","sourceType":"blog"},{"id":"blog-5g1BOvx4UriGh81tLNNg43","createdAt":"2026-09-22T03:17:26.011Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-22T03:17:26.011Z","title":"DeepL ya está disponible en Microsoft Copilot, ChatGPT y Claude a través de MCP","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Conecta DeepL a Microsoft Copilot, ChatGPT, Claude y otras herramientas compatibles para traducir texto y documentos directamente con DeepL","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-09-22T04:00+02:00","link":"/es/blog/deepl-available-in-microsoft-copilot-chatgpt-claude-mcp","sourceType":"blog"},{"id":"blog-1feRaDLVNBsP7Bw5dh8cu4","createdAt":"2026-09-15T05:37:47.445Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-15T05:37:47.445Z","title":"DeepL Voice ahora conserva tu voz en tiempo real en todos los idiomas","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"La traducción de voz en tiempo real ahora conserva el tono y la voz de cada hablante en todos los idiomas, con una aplicación de escritorio unificada para Zoom, Teams y Google Meet.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-09-15T08:00-04:00","link":"/es/blog/deepl-voice-preserves-your-voice-across-languages","sourceType":"blog"},{"id":"ailabs-Tf75UAj5SWnfpt1e1rW0P","createdAt":"2026-08-20T04:23:43.350Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-20T04:23:43.350Z","title":"La revolución de la traducción de voz: audio en tiempo real","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Descubre cómo la API de DeepL Voice combina protocolos de audio personalizados y modelos integrales de traducción de voz a voz y de latencia ultrabaja.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-08-20T04:23:43.350Z","link":"/es/ai-labs/real-time-audio-layer-transforming-voice-translation","sourceType":"aiLabs"},{"id":"ailabs-6qUCT8Vrhyv2Mo6IOkG7vE","createdAt":"2026-07-20T23:56:07.154Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-20T23:56:07.154Z","title":"Desarrollando evaluación de calidad de traducción en DeepL","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Modelos de evaluación independientes detectan errores en traducción automática, agilizan el trabajo de revisores y aumentan la confianza en localización con IA.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-07-20T23:56:07.154Z","link":"/es/ai-labs/building-translation-quality-evaluation","sourceType":"aiLabs"},{"id":"ailabs-7n9gJDN02FQEzeEXsQXmqA","createdAt":"2026-06-21T21:56:12.896Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-21T21:56:12.896Z","title":"De la traducción de texto a una plataforma de voz en tiempo real","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Descubre cómo los modelos de audio a voz reducen la latencia, captan matices y logran traducciones en tiempo real superiores a las soluciones convencionales.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-06-21T21:56:12.896Z","link":"/es/ai-labs/high-quality-text-to-real-time-voice","sourceType":"aiLabs"}],"fr":[{"id":"5OjIfi6FHdHGnmwy8XJEuC","createdAt":"2026-08-03T09:37:27.352Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-03T09:37:27.352Z","title":"DeepL pour agents IA","description":{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Vous pouvez désormais utiliser DeepL directement dans Claude, ChatGPT, Microsoft Copilot et tout agent compatible avec le protocole MCP. Désormais, vos agents traduisent exactement comme votre entreprise : avec vos termes, votre ton et vos exigences de qualité.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Les administrateurs peuvent activer ou désactiver cet accès dans les paramètres de l\'organisation.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"}],"nodeType":"document"},"publicationDate":"2026-07-15","link":"https://www.deepl.com/fr/ai-agents","linkLabel":"Découvrez DeepL pour agents IA","relatedContent":[{"metadata":{"tags":[],"concepts":[]},"sys":{"space":{"sys":{"type":"Link","linkType":"Space","id":"pplyeawnfzc7"}},"id":"4dEWf3690LvxYVkZEHToqt","type":"Entry","createdAt":"2026-07-15T10:55:54.203Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-24T12:53:59.842Z","environment":{"sys":{"id":"master","type":"Link","linkType":"Environment"}},"publishedVersion":132,"revision":21,"contentType":{"sys":{"type":"Link","linkType":"ContentType","id":"landingPage"}},"locale":"fr"},"fields":{"title":"DeepL pour agents IA : traduisez partout où travaille votre IA","description":"Connectez DeepL à Claude, ChatGPT, Microsoft Copilot et tout client MCP : retrouvez la traduction et la terminologie de votre entreprise dans vos agents IA.","urlPath":"ai-agents","urlPathVerification":"verified","publicationLocales":["ar","cs","de","en","es","fr","id","it","ja","ko","nl","pl","pt-BR","pt-PT","ru","sv","tr","uk","zh"],"dapPageId":1991,"pageOwner":"API","seoIndexation":true,"expandAllLinkCards":true,"header":[],"pageSections":[]}}],"sourceType":"notification"},{"id":"2TuRycS8zrSVTdPJh1MJX7","createdAt":"2026-07-07T12:00:16.677Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-08T15:21:02.536Z","title":"Translation Flow de DeepL : des nouveaux processus optimisés par l’IA pour vos principaux cas d\'usage et intégrations","description":{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Translation Flow intègre de nouvelles mises à jour et intégrations pour répondre aux principaux cas d\'usage, notamment Adobe Experience Manager et InDesign pour le marketing, le format XLIFF pour la formation (L&D), ainsi que SharePoint et Google Drive pour les RH et d\'autres services.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Simplifiez vos projets multilingues grâce à des processus gérés de A à Z par l’IA, et rendez Translation Flow accessible à un plus grand nombre de vos équipes.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"}],"nodeType":"document"},"publicationDate":"2026-07-07","link":"https://www.deepl.com/fr/translation-flow","linkLabel":"Découvrez Translation Flow","sourceType":"notification"},{"id":"5HVK3MiQelBTMqYffAIY9t","createdAt":"2026-06-04T22:34:12.599Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-04T22:34:12.599Z","title":"The ROI of AI-native translation","description":{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Nucleus Research found enterprise teams can cut localization spend by 80-90%, and compress timelines from weeks to hours — without the quality tradeoffs of generic AI.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"}],"nodeType":"document"},"publicationDate":"2026-06-05","link":"https://www.deepl.com/en/reports/nucleus-roi-study","linkLabel":"Read the findings","sourceType":"notification"},{"id":"blog-66YKFU5PLiw3kthXLnhjVc","createdAt":"2026-09-22T03:23:18.386Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-22T03:23:18.386Z","title":"What MCP changes about enterprise software","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Discover how the Model Context Protocol (MCP) shifts enterprise software from generalist reasoning to specialist capability. Explore expert insights on maintaining compliance, scaling AI agents, and integrating domain-specific AI into your workflow.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-09-22T00:00-05:00","link":"/fr/blog/what-mcp-changes-about-enterprise-software","sourceType":"blog"},{"id":"blog-5g1BOvx4UriGh81tLNNg43","createdAt":"2026-09-22T03:17:26.011Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-22T03:17:26.011Z","title":"DeepL est désormais disponible dans Microsoft Copilot, ChatGPT et Claude via MCP","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Connectez DeepL à Microsoft Copilot, ChatGPT, Claude et d’autres outils compatibles pour traduire du texte et des documents directement avec DeepL","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-09-22T04:00+02:00","link":"/fr/blog/deepl-available-in-microsoft-copilot-chatgpt-claude-mcp","sourceType":"blog"},{"id":"blog-1feRaDLVNBsP7Bw5dh8cu4","createdAt":"2026-09-15T05:37:47.445Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-15T05:37:47.445Z","title":"DeepL Voice préserve désormais votre voix en temps réel, quelle que soit la langue","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"La traduction vocale en temps réel préserve désormais le ton et la voix de chaque locuteur, quelle que soit la langue, grâce à une application de bureau unifiée pour Zoom, Teams et Google Meet.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-09-15T08:00-04:00","link":"/fr/blog/deepl-voice-preserves-your-voice-across-languages","sourceType":"blog"},{"id":"ailabs-Tf75UAj5SWnfpt1e1rW0P","createdAt":"2026-08-20T04:23:43.350Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-20T04:23:43.350Z","title":"L’audio en temps réel va transformer la traduction vocale","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Voici comment l\'API DeepL Voice associe des protocoles audio sur mesure et des modèles de traduction offrant une traduction voix-à-voix à très faible latence.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-08-20T04:23:43.350Z","link":"/fr/ai-labs/real-time-audio-layer-transforming-voice-translation","sourceType":"aiLabs"},{"id":"ailabs-6qUCT8Vrhyv2Mo6IOkG7vE","createdAt":"2026-07-20T23:56:07.154Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-20T23:56:07.154Z","title":"Évaluation qualité traduction chez DeepL","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Découvrez comment des modèles d\'évaluation indépendants détectent les erreurs de traduction IA, optimisent les révisions et renforcent la confiance.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-07-20T23:56:07.154Z","link":"/fr/ai-labs/building-translation-quality-evaluation","sourceType":"aiLabs"},{"id":"ailabs-7n9gJDN02FQEzeEXsQXmqA","createdAt":"2026-06-21T21:56:12.896Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-21T21:56:12.896Z","title":"De la traduction de texte à la traduction vocale en temps réel","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Voici comment les modèles « audio-to-speech » minimisent la latence et capturent les nuances, pour une traduction en direct qui surpasse les outils standards.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-06-21T21:56:12.896Z","link":"/fr/ai-labs/high-quality-text-to-real-time-voice","sourceType":"aiLabs"}],"id":[{"id":"5OjIfi6FHdHGnmwy8XJEuC","createdAt":"2026-08-03T09:37:27.352Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-03T09:37:27.352Z","title":"DeepL untuk agen AI","description":{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Kini Anda dapat menggunakan DeepL langsung di Claude, ChatGPT, Microsoft Copilot, dan agen apa pun yang kompatibel dengan MCP. Kini, agen Anda dapat menerjemahkan sesuai dengan cara perusahaan Anda: menggunakan istilah, bentuk bahasa, dan standar kualitas Anda.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Admin dapat mengaktifkan atau menonaktifkan akses ini di pengaturan organisasi.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"}],"nodeType":"document"},"publicationDate":"2026-07-15","link":"https://www.deepl.com/id/ai-agents","linkLabel":"Jelajahi DeepL untuk agen AI","relatedContent":[{"metadata":{"tags":[],"concepts":[]},"sys":{"space":{"sys":{"type":"Link","linkType":"Space","id":"pplyeawnfzc7"}},"id":"4dEWf3690LvxYVkZEHToqt","type":"Entry","createdAt":"2026-07-15T10:55:54.203Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-24T12:53:59.842Z","environment":{"sys":{"id":"master","type":"Link","linkType":"Environment"}},"publishedVersion":132,"revision":21,"contentType":{"sys":{"type":"Link","linkType":"ContentType","id":"landingPage"}},"locale":"id"},"fields":{"title":"DeepL untuk agen AI: menerjemahkan bersama AI Anda","description":"Hubungkan DeepL ke Claude, ChatGPT, Copilot, dan klien MCP. Dapatkan terjemahan, tulisan, dan gunakan peristilahan perusahaan langsung di AI Anda.","urlPath":"ai-agents","urlPathVerification":"verified","publicationLocales":["ar","cs","de","en","es","fr","id","it","ja","ko","nl","pl","pt-BR","pt-PT","ru","sv","tr","uk","zh"],"dapPageId":1991,"pageOwner":"API","seoIndexation":true,"expandAllLinkCards":true,"header":[],"pageSections":[]}}],"sourceType":"notification"},{"id":"2TuRycS8zrSVTdPJh1MJX7","createdAt":"2026-07-07T12:00:16.677Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-08T15:21:02.536Z","title":"Translation Flow DeepL: Alur kerja baru yang didukung AI untuk kasus penggunaan utama dan integrasi","description":{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Translation Flow telah menambahkan pembaruan dan integrasi baru untuk mendukung kasus penggunaan utama, termasuk Adobe Experience Manager dan InDesign untuk Pemasaran; XLIFF untuk Pembelajaran dan Pengembangan (L&D); serta SharePoint dan Google Drive untuk SDM dan lainnya.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Sederhanakan proyek multibahasa dengan alur kerja end-to-end yang mengutamakan AI, dan jadikan Translation Flow dapat diakses oleh lebih banyak tim fungsional Anda.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"}],"nodeType":"document"},"publicationDate":"2026-07-07","link":"https://www.deepl.com/id/translation-flow","linkLabel":"Jelajahi Translation Flow","sourceType":"notification"},{"id":"5HVK3MiQelBTMqYffAIY9t","createdAt":"2026-06-04T22:34:12.599Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-04T22:34:12.599Z","title":"The ROI of AI-native translation","description":{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Nucleus Research found enterprise teams can cut localization spend by 80-90%, and compress timelines from weeks to hours — without the quality tradeoffs of generic AI.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"}],"nodeType":"document"},"publicationDate":"2026-06-05","link":"https://www.deepl.com/en/reports/nucleus-roi-study","linkLabel":"Read the findings","sourceType":"notification"},{"id":"blog-66YKFU5PLiw3kthXLnhjVc","createdAt":"2026-09-22T03:23:18.386Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-22T03:23:18.386Z","title":"What MCP changes about enterprise software","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Discover how the Model Context Protocol (MCP) shifts enterprise software from generalist reasoning to specialist capability. Explore expert insights on maintaining compliance, scaling AI agents, and integrating domain-specific AI into your workflow.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-09-22T00:00-05:00","link":"/id/blog/what-mcp-changes-about-enterprise-software","sourceType":"blog"},{"id":"blog-5g1BOvx4UriGh81tLNNg43","createdAt":"2026-09-22T03:17:26.011Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-22T03:17:26.011Z","title":"DeepL kini tersedia di Microsoft Copilot, ChatGPT, dan Claude melalui MCP","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Hubungkan DeepL ke Microsoft Copilot, ChatGPT, Claude, dan alat lain yang kompatibel untuk menerjemahkan teks dan dokumen secara langsung dengan DeepL","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-09-22T04:00+02:00","link":"/id/blog/deepl-available-in-microsoft-copilot-chatgpt-claude-mcp","sourceType":"blog"},{"id":"blog-1feRaDLVNBsP7Bw5dh8cu4","createdAt":"2026-09-15T05:37:47.445Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-15T05:37:47.445Z","title":"DeepL Voice kini mempertahankan suara Anda secara real-time di berbagai bahasa","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Terjemahan suara secara real-time kini mempertahankan bentuk dan suara setiap pembicara di berbagai bahasa, dengan aplikasi desktop terpadu untuk Zoom, Teams, dan Google Meet.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-09-15T08:00-04:00","link":"/id/blog/deepl-voice-preserves-your-voice-across-languages","sourceType":"blog"},{"id":"ailabs-Tf75UAj5SWnfpt1e1rW0P","createdAt":"2026-08-20T04:23:43.350Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-20T04:23:43.350Z","title":"Lapisan audio real-time yang siap merevolusi terjemahan suara","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"DeepL Voice API menggabungkan protokol audio khusus dan model terjemahan end-to-end untuk audio speech-to-speech dengan latensi sangat rendah.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-08-20T04:23:43.350Z","link":"/id/ai-labs/real-time-audio-layer-transforming-voice-translation","sourceType":"aiLabs"},{"id":"ailabs-6qUCT8Vrhyv2Mo6IOkG7vE","createdAt":"2026-07-20T23:56:07.154Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-20T23:56:07.154Z","title":"Sistem Evaluasi Mutu Terjemahan DeepL: Cara Pengembangannya","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Pelajari bagaimana model evaluasi independen mendeteksi kesalahan terjemahan mesin, menyederhanakan alur kerja, dan meningkatkan kepercayaan lokalisasi AI.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-07-20T23:56:07.154Z","link":"/id/ai-labs/building-translation-quality-evaluation","sourceType":"aiLabs"},{"id":"ailabs-7n9gJDN02FQEzeEXsQXmqA","createdAt":"2026-06-21T21:56:12.896Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-21T21:56:12.896Z","title":"Terjemahan teks berkualitas tinggi ke platform suara real-time","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Model audio-ke-ucapan langsung minimalkan latensi dan tangkap nuansa vokal, tawarkan terjemahan real-time lebih unggul dari alat standar.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-06-21T21:56:12.896Z","link":"/id/ai-labs/high-quality-text-to-real-time-voice","sourceType":"aiLabs"}],"it":[{"id":"5OjIfi6FHdHGnmwy8XJEuC","createdAt":"2026-08-03T09:37:27.352Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-03T09:37:27.352Z","title":"DeepL per gli agenti IA","description":{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Ora puoi usare DeepL direttamente su Claude, ChatGPT, Microsoft Copilot e qualsiasi agente compatibile con MCP. Ora i tuoi agenti possono tradurre proprio come fa la tua azienda: con i tuoi termini, il tuo tono e i tuoi standard di qualità.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Gli amministratori possono abilitare o disabilitare l\'accesso nelle impostazioni dell\'organizzazione.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"}],"nodeType":"document"},"publicationDate":"2026-07-15","link":"https://www.deepl.com/it/ai-agents","linkLabel":"Scopri DeepL per gli agenti IA","relatedContent":[{"metadata":{"tags":[],"concepts":[]},"sys":{"space":{"sys":{"type":"Link","linkType":"Space","id":"pplyeawnfzc7"}},"id":"4dEWf3690LvxYVkZEHToqt","type":"Entry","createdAt":"2026-07-15T10:55:54.203Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-24T12:53:59.842Z","environment":{"sys":{"id":"master","type":"Link","linkType":"Environment"}},"publishedVersion":132,"revision":21,"contentType":{"sys":{"type":"Link","linkType":"ContentType","id":"landingPage"}},"locale":"it"},"fields":{"title":"DeepL per gli agenti IA: traduci ovunque lavori la tua IA","description":"Collega DeepL a Claude, ChatGPT, Copilot e client MCP: traduzione, scrittura e terminologia aziendale direttamente nei tuoi agenti IA.","urlPath":"ai-agents","urlPathVerification":"verified","publicationLocales":["ar","cs","de","en","es","fr","id","it","ja","ko","nl","pl","pt-BR","pt-PT","ru","sv","tr","uk","zh"],"dapPageId":1991,"pageOwner":"API","seoIndexation":true,"expandAllLinkCards":true,"header":[],"pageSections":[]}}],"sourceType":"notification"},{"id":"2TuRycS8zrSVTdPJh1MJX7","createdAt":"2026-07-07T12:00:16.677Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-08T15:21:02.536Z","title":"Translation Flow di DeepL: Nuovi flussi di lavoro basati sull\'IA per casi d\'uso chiave e integrazioni","description":{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Translation Flow ha aggiunto nuovi aggiornamenti e integrazioni per potenziare i casi d\'uso principali, tra cui Adobe Experience Manager e InDesign per il marketing; XLIFF per la formazione e lo sviluppo; e SharePoint e Google Drive per le risorse umane e altro ancora.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Semplifica i progetti multilingue con flussi di lavoro end-to-end basati sull’IA e rendi Translation Flow accessibile a un numero ancora maggiore dei tuoi team funzionali.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"}],"nodeType":"document"},"publicationDate":"2026-07-07","link":"https://www.deepl.com/it/translation-flow","linkLabel":"Scopri Translation Flow","sourceType":"notification"},{"id":"5HVK3MiQelBTMqYffAIY9t","createdAt":"2026-06-04T22:34:12.599Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-04T22:34:12.599Z","title":"The ROI of AI-native translation","description":{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Nucleus Research found enterprise teams can cut localization spend by 80-90%, and compress timelines from weeks to hours — without the quality tradeoffs of generic AI.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"}],"nodeType":"document"},"publicationDate":"2026-06-05","link":"https://www.deepl.com/en/reports/nucleus-roi-study","linkLabel":"Read the findings","sourceType":"notification"},{"id":"blog-66YKFU5PLiw3kthXLnhjVc","createdAt":"2026-09-22T03:23:18.386Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-22T03:23:18.386Z","title":"What MCP changes about enterprise software","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Discover how the Model Context Protocol (MCP) shifts enterprise software from generalist reasoning to specialist capability. Explore expert insights on maintaining compliance, scaling AI agents, and integrating domain-specific AI into your workflow.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-09-22T00:00-05:00","link":"/it/blog/what-mcp-changes-about-enterprise-software","sourceType":"blog"},{"id":"blog-5g1BOvx4UriGh81tLNNg43","createdAt":"2026-09-22T03:17:26.011Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-22T03:17:26.011Z","title":"DeepL è ora disponibile su Microsoft Copilot, ChatGPT e Claude tramite MCP","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Collega DeepL a Microsoft Copilot, ChatGPT, Claude e altri strumenti compatibili per tradurre testi e documenti direttamente con DeepL","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-09-22T04:00+02:00","link":"/it/blog/deepl-available-in-microsoft-copilot-chatgpt-claude-mcp","sourceType":"blog"},{"id":"blog-1feRaDLVNBsP7Bw5dh8cu4","createdAt":"2026-09-15T05:37:47.445Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-15T05:37:47.445Z","title":"DeepL Voice ora mantiene la tua voce in tempo reale in tutte le lingue","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"La traduzione vocale in tempo reale ora mantiene il tono e la voce di ogni parlante in tutte le lingue, con un\'app desktop unificata per Zoom, Teams e Google Meet.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-09-15T08:00-04:00","link":"/it/blog/deepl-voice-preserves-your-voice-across-languages","sourceType":"blog"},{"id":"ailabs-Tf75UAj5SWnfpt1e1rW0P","createdAt":"2026-08-20T04:23:43.350Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-20T04:23:43.350Z","title":"Audio in tempo reale che rivoluziona la traduzione vocale","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Scopri come l\'API DeepL Voice unisce protocolli audio e modelli end-to-end per audio voce-voce a bassissima latenza.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-08-20T04:23:43.350Z","link":"/it/ai-labs/real-time-audio-layer-transforming-voice-translation","sourceType":"aiLabs"},{"id":"ailabs-6qUCT8Vrhyv2Mo6IOkG7vE","createdAt":"2026-07-20T23:56:07.154Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-20T23:56:07.154Z","title":"Sistema di valutazione qualità traduzioni DeepL in sviluppo","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"I modelli di valutazione indipendenti individuano errori di traduzione automatica, ottimizzano i flussi di lavoro e aumentano la fiducia nella localizzazione IA","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-07-20T23:56:07.154Z","link":"/it/ai-labs/building-translation-quality-evaluation","sourceType":"aiLabs"},{"id":"ailabs-7n9gJDN02FQEzeEXsQXmqA","createdAt":"2026-06-21T21:56:12.896Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-21T21:56:12.896Z","title":"Da traduzione testi a piattaforma vocale in tempo reale","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Modelli di sintesi vocale diretta riducono la latenza e acquisiscono sfumature vocali, offrendo traduzioni in tempo reale superiori agli strumenti standard.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-06-21T21:56:12.896Z","link":"/it/ai-labs/high-quality-text-to-real-time-voice","sourceType":"aiLabs"}],"ja":[{"id":"5OjIfi6FHdHGnmwy8XJEuC","createdAt":"2026-08-03T09:37:27.352Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-03T09:37:27.352Z","title":"AIエージェント向けDeepL","description":{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Claude、ChatGPT、Microsoft Copilot、およびMCP対応のエージェントであれば、DeepLを直接ご利用いただけるようになりました。これにより、エージェントは貴社の用語、語調、品質基準に沿った翻訳ができるようになります。","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"管理者は、組織の設定でこの機能を有効または無効にすることができます。","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"}],"nodeType":"document"},"publicationDate":"2026-07-15","link":"https://www.deepl.com/ja/ai-agents","linkLabel":"AIエージェント向けDeepLの詳細","relatedContent":[{"metadata":{"tags":[],"concepts":[]},"sys":{"space":{"sys":{"type":"Link","linkType":"Space","id":"pplyeawnfzc7"}},"id":"4dEWf3690LvxYVkZEHToqt","type":"Entry","createdAt":"2026-07-15T10:55:54.203Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-24T12:53:59.842Z","environment":{"sys":{"id":"master","type":"Link","linkType":"Environment"}},"publishedVersion":132,"revision":21,"contentType":{"sys":{"type":"Link","linkType":"ContentType","id":"landingPage"}},"locale":"ja"},"fields":{"title":"AIエージェント向けDeepL：AIが動作するあらゆる場所で翻訳が可能に","description":"DeepLをClaude、ChatGPT、Microsoft Copilot、MCPクライアントに連携させれば、AIエージェント内で貴社の用語に沿って翻訳や文章作成ができるようになります。","urlPath":"ai-agents","urlPathVerification":"verified","publicationLocales":["ar","cs","de","en","es","fr","id","it","ja","ko","nl","pl","pt-BR","pt-PT","ru","sv","tr","uk","zh"],"dapPageId":1991,"pageOwner":"API","seoIndexation":true,"expandAllLinkCards":true,"header":[],"pageSections":[]}}],"sourceType":"notification"},{"id":"2TuRycS8zrSVTdPJh1MJX7","createdAt":"2026-07-07T12:00:16.677Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-08T15:21:02.536Z","title":"DeepL Translation Flow：主要なユースケースや連携機能に対応する、AIを活用した新しいワークフロー","description":{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Translation Flowに、Adobe Experience ManagerやInDesign、L&D向けのXLIFF、人事（HR）向けのSharePointやGoogle Driveなど、主要なユースケースを支える新たなアップデートと連携機能が追加されました。","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"AIを中核としたエンドツーエンドのワークフローで多言語プロジェクトを効率化し、より多くの部門でTranslation Flowを活用できるようになります。","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"}],"nodeType":"document"},"publicationDate":"2026-07-07","link":"https://www.deepl.com/ja/translation-flow","linkLabel":"Translation Flowの詳細を見る","sourceType":"notification"},{"id":"5HVK3MiQelBTMqYffAIY9t","createdAt":"2026-06-04T22:34:12.599Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-04T22:34:12.599Z","title":"The ROI of AI-native translation","description":{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Nucleus Research found enterprise teams can cut localization spend by 80-90%, and compress timelines from weeks to hours — without the quality tradeoffs of generic AI.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"}],"nodeType":"document"},"publicationDate":"2026-06-05","link":"https://www.deepl.com/en/reports/nucleus-roi-study","linkLabel":"Read the findings","sourceType":"notification"},{"id":"blog-66YKFU5PLiw3kthXLnhjVc","createdAt":"2026-09-22T03:23:18.386Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-22T03:23:18.386Z","title":"What MCP changes about enterprise software","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Discover how the Model Context Protocol (MCP) shifts enterprise software from generalist reasoning to specialist capability. Explore expert insights on maintaining compliance, scaling AI agents, and integrating domain-specific AI into your workflow.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-09-22T00:00-05:00","link":"/ja/blog/what-mcp-changes-about-enterprise-software","sourceType":"blog"},{"id":"blog-5g1BOvx4UriGh81tLNNg43","createdAt":"2026-09-22T03:17:26.011Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-22T03:17:26.011Z","title":"DeepLが、MCPを通じてMicrosoft Copilot、ChatGPT、Claudeで利用可能になりました","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"DeepLをMicrosoft Copilot、ChatGPT、Claude、およびその他の互換ツールに連携させ、テキストの翻訳や文書の翻訳をDeepLで直接行うことができるようになりました","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-09-22T04:00+02:00","link":"/ja/blog/deepl-available-in-microsoft-copilot-chatgpt-claude-mcp","sourceType":"blog"},{"id":"blog-1feRaDLVNBsP7Bw5dh8cu4","createdAt":"2026-09-15T05:37:47.445Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-15T05:37:47.445Z","title":"DeepL Voiceでは、言語を問わず、リアルタイムで話者の声をそのまま再現できるようになりました","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"リアルタイム音声翻訳により、言語を問わず各話者の語調や声のニュアンスを再現できるようになりました。Zoom、Teams、Google Meetに対応した統合デスクトップアプリもご利用いただけます。","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-09-15T08:00-04:00","link":"/ja/blog/deepl-voice-preserves-your-voice-across-languages","sourceType":"blog"},{"id":"ailabs-Tf75UAj5SWnfpt1e1rW0P","createdAt":"2026-08-20T04:23:43.350Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-20T04:23:43.350Z","title":"音声翻訳を変える、リアルタイム音声レイヤー","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"DeepL Voice APIが、独自のオーディオプロトコルとエンドツーエンドの翻訳モデルを組み合わせ、超低遅延の音声間翻訳を実現する仕組みをご紹介します。","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-08-20T04:23:43.350Z","link":"/ja/ai-labs/real-time-audio-layer-transforming-voice-translation","sourceType":"aiLabs"},{"id":"ailabs-6qUCT8Vrhyv2Mo6IOkG7vE","createdAt":"2026-07-20T23:56:07.154Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-20T23:56:07.154Z","title":"DeepLにおける翻訳品質評価の構築方法","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"独立した評価モデルが、機械翻訳の誤りをどのように検出するか、レビュー者のワークフローをどのように効率化するか、そしてAIローカライゼーションへの信頼をどのように高めるかについてご紹介します。","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-07-20T23:56:07.154Z","link":"/ja/ai-labs/building-translation-quality-evaluation","sourceType":"aiLabs"},{"id":"ailabs-7n9gJDN02FQEzeEXsQXmqA","createdAt":"2026-06-21T21:56:12.896Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-21T21:56:12.896Z","title":"高品質なテキスト翻訳からリアルタイム音声翻訳までを支えるDeepLの言語AI","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"ダイレクト音声変換モデルが、どのように遅延を最小限に抑え、話し方のニュアンスを捉えながら、従来のツールを上回るリアルタイム翻訳を実現しているのかをご覧ください。","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-06-21T21:56:12.896Z","link":"/ja/ai-labs/high-quality-text-to-real-time-voice","sourceType":"aiLabs"}],"ko":[{"id":"5OjIfi6FHdHGnmwy8XJEuC","createdAt":"2026-08-03T09:37:27.352Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-03T09:37:27.352Z","title":"AI 에이전트용 DeepL","description":{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"이제 Claude, ChatGPT, Microsoft Copilot 및 MCP 호환 에이전트에서 바로 DeepL을 사용할 수 있습니다. 이제 에이전트가 귀사의 용어, 어조, 품질 기준에 맞춰 번역할 수 있습니다.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"관리자는 조직 설정에서 이 기능의 사용을 활성화하거나 비활성화할 수 있습니다.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"}],"nodeType":"document"},"publicationDate":"2026-07-15","link":"https://www.deepl.com/ko/ai-agents","linkLabel":"AI 에이전트용 DeepL 살펴보기","relatedContent":[{"metadata":{"tags":[],"concepts":[]},"sys":{"space":{"sys":{"type":"Link","linkType":"Space","id":"pplyeawnfzc7"}},"id":"4dEWf3690LvxYVkZEHToqt","type":"Entry","createdAt":"2026-07-15T10:55:54.203Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-24T12:53:59.842Z","environment":{"sys":{"id":"master","type":"Link","linkType":"Environment"}},"publishedVersion":132,"revision":21,"contentType":{"sys":{"type":"Link","linkType":"ContentType","id":"landingPage"}},"locale":"ko"},"fields":{"title":"AI 에이전트용 DeepL: AI가 작동하는 곳이라면 어디서나 번역 가능","description":"DeepL을 Claude, ChatGPT, Microsoft Copilot 및 모든 MCP 클라이언트에 연결하여 AI 에이전트 내에서 번역, 글쓰기 및 귀사의 용어를 활용하세요.","urlPath":"ai-agents","urlPathVerification":"verified","publicationLocales":["ar","cs","de","en","es","fr","id","it","ja","ko","nl","pl","pt-BR","pt-PT","ru","sv","tr","uk","zh"],"dapPageId":1991,"pageOwner":"API","seoIndexation":true,"expandAllLinkCards":true,"header":[],"pageSections":[]}}],"sourceType":"notification"},{"id":"2TuRycS8zrSVTdPJh1MJX7","createdAt":"2026-07-07T12:00:16.677Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-08T15:21:02.536Z","title":"DeepL Translation Flow: 주요 사용 사례 및 통합 기능을 위한 새로운 AI 기반 워크플로우","description":{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Translation Flow는 Adobe Experience Manager 및 마케팅용 InDesign, 교육 및 개발(L&D)용 XLIFF, 인사(HR) 및 기타 분야용 SharePoint와 Google Drive 등 주요 사용 사례를 지원하기 위한 새로운 업데이트와 연동 기능을 추가했습니다.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"AI 중심의 종단간 워크플로우를 통해 다국어 프로젝트를 간소화하고, 더 많은 기능별 팀이 Translation Flow를 활용할 수 있도록 하세요.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"}],"nodeType":"document"},"publicationDate":"2026-07-07","link":"https://www.deepl.com/ko/translation-flow","linkLabel":"Translation Flow 살펴보기","sourceType":"notification"},{"id":"5HVK3MiQelBTMqYffAIY9t","createdAt":"2026-06-04T22:34:12.599Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-04T22:34:12.599Z","title":"The ROI of AI-native translation","description":{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Nucleus Research found enterprise teams can cut localization spend by 80-90%, and compress timelines from weeks to hours — without the quality tradeoffs of generic AI.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"}],"nodeType":"document"},"publicationDate":"2026-06-05","link":"https://www.deepl.com/en/reports/nucleus-roi-study","linkLabel":"Read the findings","sourceType":"notification"},{"id":"blog-66YKFU5PLiw3kthXLnhjVc","createdAt":"2026-09-22T03:23:18.386Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-22T03:23:18.386Z","title":"What MCP changes about enterprise software","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Discover how the Model Context Protocol (MCP) shifts enterprise software from generalist reasoning to specialist capability. Explore expert insights on maintaining compliance, scaling AI agents, and integrating domain-specific AI into your workflow.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-09-22T00:00-05:00","link":"/ko/blog/what-mcp-changes-about-enterprise-software","sourceType":"blog"},{"id":"blog-5g1BOvx4UriGh81tLNNg43","createdAt":"2026-09-22T03:17:26.011Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-22T03:17:26.011Z","title":"이제 MCP를 통해 Microsoft Copilot, ChatGPT 및 Claude에서 DeepL을 이용할 수 있습니다","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"DeepL을 Microsoft Copilot, ChatGPT, Claude 및 기타 호환 가능한 도구와 연결하여 텍스트 번역과 문서 번역을 DeepL로 직접 수행해 보세요","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-09-22T04:00+02:00","link":"/ko/blog/deepl-available-in-microsoft-copilot-chatgpt-claude-mcp","sourceType":"blog"},{"id":"blog-1feRaDLVNBsP7Bw5dh8cu4","createdAt":"2026-09-15T05:37:47.445Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-15T05:37:47.445Z","title":"DeepL Voice, 이제 여러 언어 간에도 사용자의 목소리를 실시간으로 그대로 유지합니다","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"실시간 음성 번역 기능이 이제 Zoom, Teams, Google Meet용 통합 데스크톱 앱을 통해 언어 간에도 각 화자의 어조와 목소리를 그대로 유지합니다.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-09-15T08:00-04:00","link":"/ko/blog/deepl-voice-preserves-your-voice-across-languages","sourceType":"blog"},{"id":"ailabs-Tf75UAj5SWnfpt1e1rW0P","createdAt":"2026-08-20T04:23:43.350Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-20T04:23:43.350Z","title":"음성 번역의 패러다임을 바꿀 준비가 된 실시간 오디오 레이어","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"DeepL Voice API가 맞춤형 오디오 프로토콜과 종단간 번역 모델을 결합하여 초저지연 음성-음성 변환을 구현하는 방식을 살펴보세요.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-08-20T04:23:43.350Z","link":"/ko/ai-labs/real-time-audio-layer-transforming-voice-translation","sourceType":"aiLabs"},{"id":"ailabs-6qUCT8Vrhyv2Mo6IOkG7vE","createdAt":"2026-07-20T23:56:07.154Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-20T23:56:07.154Z","title":"DeepL의 번역 품질 평가 시스템을 구축하는 방법","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"독립적인 평가 모델이 기계번역 오류를 어떻게 탐지하고, 검토자 업무 흐름을 간소화하며, AI 현지화에 대한 신뢰도를 높이는지 알아보세요.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-07-20T23:56:07.154Z","link":"/ko/ai-labs/building-translation-quality-evaluation","sourceType":"aiLabs"},{"id":"ailabs-7n9gJDN02FQEzeEXsQXmqA","createdAt":"2026-06-21T21:56:12.896Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-21T21:56:12.896Z","title":"고품질 텍스트 번역에서 실시간 음성 플랫폼까지","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"직접 음성-텍스트 변환 모델이 어떻게 지연 시간을 최소화하고 목소리의 미묘한 뉘앙스를 포착하여, 기존 도구를 뛰어넘는 실시간 번역을 제공하는지 알아보세요.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-06-21T21:56:12.896Z","link":"/ko/ai-labs/high-quality-text-to-real-time-voice","sourceType":"aiLabs"}],"nl":[{"id":"5OjIfi6FHdHGnmwy8XJEuC","createdAt":"2026-08-03T09:37:27.352Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-03T09:37:27.352Z","title":"DeepL voor AI-agenten","description":{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"U kunt DeepL nu rechtstreeks gebruiken in Claude, ChatGPT, Microsoft Copilot en elke MCP-compatibele agent. Uw agents kunnen nu vertalen op de manier die bij uw bedrijf past: met uw termen, uw toon en uw kwaliteitsnormen.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Beheerders kunnen de toegang in de organisatie-instellingen in- of uitschakelen.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"}],"nodeType":"document"},"publicationDate":"2026-07-15","link":"https://www.deepl.com/nl/ai-agents","linkLabel":"Ontdek DeepL voor AI-agenten","relatedContent":[{"metadata":{"tags":[],"concepts":[]},"sys":{"space":{"sys":{"type":"Link","linkType":"Space","id":"pplyeawnfzc7"}},"id":"4dEWf3690LvxYVkZEHToqt","type":"Entry","createdAt":"2026-07-15T10:55:54.203Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-24T12:53:59.842Z","environment":{"sys":{"id":"master","type":"Link","linkType":"Environment"}},"publishedVersion":132,"revision":21,"contentType":{"sys":{"type":"Link","linkType":"ContentType","id":"landingPage"}},"locale":"nl"},"fields":{"title":"DeepL voor AI-agenten: vertaal overal waar uw AI actief is","description":"Koppel DeepL aan Claude, ChatGPT, Microsoft Copilot en elke MCP-klant — vertalen, schrijven en de terminologie van uw bedrijf binnen uw AI-agenten.","urlPath":"ai-agents","urlPathVerification":"verified","publicationLocales":["ar","cs","de","en","es","fr","id","it","ja","ko","nl","pl","pt-BR","pt-PT","ru","sv","tr","uk","zh"],"dapPageId":1991,"pageOwner":"API","seoIndexation":true,"expandAllLinkCards":true,"header":[],"pageSections":[]}}],"sourceType":"notification"},{"id":"2TuRycS8zrSVTdPJh1MJX7","createdAt":"2026-07-07T12:00:16.677Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-08T15:21:02.536Z","title":"DeepL Translation Flow: Nieuwe, door AI aangestuurde workflows voor belangrijke toepassingen en integraties","description":{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Translation Flow is uitgebreid met nieuwe updates en integraties ter ondersteuning van belangrijke toepassingen, waaronder Adobe Experience Manager en InDesign voor marketing; XLIFF voor L&D; en SharePoint en Google Drive voor HR en andere afdelingen.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Stroomlijn meertalige projecten met AI-gestuurde, end-to-end-workflows en maak Translation Flow toegankelijk voor nog meer van uw functionele teams.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"}],"nodeType":"document"},"publicationDate":"2026-07-07","link":"https://www.deepl.com/nl/translation-flow","linkLabel":"Ontdek Translation Flow","sourceType":"notification"},{"id":"5HVK3MiQelBTMqYffAIY9t","createdAt":"2026-06-04T22:34:12.599Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-04T22:34:12.599Z","title":"The ROI of AI-native translation","description":{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Nucleus Research found enterprise teams can cut localization spend by 80-90%, and compress timelines from weeks to hours — without the quality tradeoffs of generic AI.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"}],"nodeType":"document"},"publicationDate":"2026-06-05","link":"https://www.deepl.com/en/reports/nucleus-roi-study","linkLabel":"Read the findings","sourceType":"notification"},{"id":"blog-66YKFU5PLiw3kthXLnhjVc","createdAt":"2026-09-22T03:23:18.386Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-22T03:23:18.386Z","title":"What MCP changes about enterprise software","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Discover how the Model Context Protocol (MCP) shifts enterprise software from generalist reasoning to specialist capability. Explore expert insights on maintaining compliance, scaling AI agents, and integrating domain-specific AI into your workflow.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-09-22T00:00-05:00","link":"/nl/blog/what-mcp-changes-about-enterprise-software","sourceType":"blog"},{"id":"blog-5g1BOvx4UriGh81tLNNg43","createdAt":"2026-09-22T03:17:26.011Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-22T03:17:26.011Z","title":"DeepL is nu via MCP beschikbaar in Microsoft Copilot, ChatGPT en Claude","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Koppel DeepL aan Microsoft Copilot, ChatGPT, Claude en andere compatibele tools om tekst en documenten rechtstreeks met DeepL te vertalen","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-09-22T04:00+02:00","link":"/nl/blog/deepl-available-in-microsoft-copilot-chatgpt-claude-mcp","sourceType":"blog"},{"id":"blog-1feRaDLVNBsP7Bw5dh8cu4","createdAt":"2026-09-15T05:37:47.445Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-15T05:37:47.445Z","title":"DeepL Voice behoudt nu uw stemgeluid in realtime, ongeacht de taal","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Realtime stemvertaling behoudt nu de toon en stem van elke spreker in alle talen, met één desktop-app voor Zoom, Teams en Google Meet.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-09-15T08:00-04:00","link":"/nl/blog/deepl-voice-preserves-your-voice-across-languages","sourceType":"blog"},{"id":"ailabs-Tf75UAj5SWnfpt1e1rW0P","createdAt":"2026-08-20T04:23:43.350Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-20T04:23:43.350Z","title":"Realtime audiolaag voor stemvertaling-transformatie","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Ontdek hoe DeepL Voice API aangepaste audioprotocollen en end-to-end-vertaalmodellen combineert voor spraak-naar-spraak met ultralage latentie.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-08-20T04:23:43.350Z","link":"/nl/ai-labs/real-time-audio-layer-transforming-voice-translation","sourceType":"aiLabs"},{"id":"ailabs-6qUCT8Vrhyv2Mo6IOkG7vE","createdAt":"2026-07-20T23:56:07.154Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-20T23:56:07.154Z","title":"Hoe wij de kwaliteitsbeoordeling voor DeepL ontwikkelen","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Ontdek hoe evaluatiemodellen fouten in automatische vertalingen opsporen, workflows stroomlijnen en vertrouwen in AI-lokalisatie vergroten.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-07-20T23:56:07.154Z","link":"/nl/ai-labs/building-translation-quality-evaluation","sourceType":"aiLabs"},{"id":"ailabs-7n9gJDN02FQEzeEXsQXmqA","createdAt":"2026-06-21T21:56:12.896Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-21T21:56:12.896Z","title":"Van hoogwaardige tekstvertalingen tot een realtime spraakplatform","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Directe audio-naar-spraakmodellen minimaliseren vertraging en leggen vocale nuances vast voor realtime vertalingen die standaardtools overtreffen.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-06-21T21:56:12.896Z","link":"/nl/ai-labs/high-quality-text-to-real-time-voice","sourceType":"aiLabs"}],"pl":[{"id":"5OjIfi6FHdHGnmwy8XJEuC","createdAt":"2026-08-03T09:37:27.352Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-03T09:37:27.352Z","title":"DeepL dla agentów AI","description":{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Teraz możesz korzystać z DeepL bezpośrednio w Claude, ChatGPT, Microsoft Copilot i każdym agencie zgodnym z MCP. Teraz twoje agenty mogą tłumaczyć tak, jak to robi twoja firma: używając twoich terminów, tonu i standardów jakości.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Administratorzy mogą włączyć lub wyłączyć dostęp w ustawieniach organizacji.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"}],"nodeType":"document"},"publicationDate":"2026-07-15","link":"https://www.deepl.com/pl/ai-agents","linkLabel":"Poznaj DeepL dla agentów AI","relatedContent":[{"metadata":{"tags":[],"concepts":[]},"sys":{"space":{"sys":{"type":"Link","linkType":"Space","id":"pplyeawnfzc7"}},"id":"4dEWf3690LvxYVkZEHToqt","type":"Entry","createdAt":"2026-07-15T10:55:54.203Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-24T12:53:59.842Z","environment":{"sys":{"id":"master","type":"Link","linkType":"Environment"}},"publishedVersion":132,"revision":21,"contentType":{"sys":{"type":"Link","linkType":"ContentType","id":"landingPage"}},"locale":"pl"},"fields":{"title":"DeepL dla AI: tłumacz wszędzie tam, gdzie działa Twoja AI","description":"Połącz DeepL z Claude, ChatGPT, Microsoft Copilot i dowolnym klientem MCP — tłumaczenia, pisanie i terminologia Twojej firmy bezpośrednio w agentach AI.","urlPath":"ai-agents","urlPathVerification":"verified","publicationLocales":["ar","cs","de","en","es","fr","id","it","ja","ko","nl","pl","pt-BR","pt-PT","ru","sv","tr","uk","zh"],"dapPageId":1991,"pageOwner":"API","seoIndexation":true,"expandAllLinkCards":true,"header":[],"pageSections":[]}}],"sourceType":"notification"},{"id":"2TuRycS8zrSVTdPJh1MJX7","createdAt":"2026-07-07T12:00:16.677Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-08T15:21:02.536Z","title":"Translation Flow w DeepL: Nowe procesy oparte na AI dla kluczowych zastosowań i integracji","description":{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Translation Flow zyskało nowe aktualizacje i integracje, które usprawniają kluczowe zastosowania, w tym Adobe Experience Manager i InDesign dla marketingu; XLIFF dla szkoleń i rozwoju; oraz SharePoint i Google Drive dla HR i innych działów.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Usprawnij projekty wielojęzyczne dzięki kompleksowym procesom opartym na AI i udostępnij Translation Flow jeszcze większej liczbie zespołów w firmie.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"}],"nodeType":"document"},"publicationDate":"2026-07-07","link":"https://www.deepl.com/pl/translation-flow","linkLabel":"Poznaj Translation Flow","sourceType":"notification"},{"id":"5HVK3MiQelBTMqYffAIY9t","createdAt":"2026-06-04T22:34:12.599Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-04T22:34:12.599Z","title":"The ROI of AI-native translation","description":{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Nucleus Research found enterprise teams can cut localization spend by 80-90%, and compress timelines from weeks to hours — without the quality tradeoffs of generic AI.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"}],"nodeType":"document"},"publicationDate":"2026-06-05","link":"https://www.deepl.com/en/reports/nucleus-roi-study","linkLabel":"Read the findings","sourceType":"notification"},{"id":"blog-66YKFU5PLiw3kthXLnhjVc","createdAt":"2026-09-22T03:23:18.386Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-22T03:23:18.386Z","title":"What MCP changes about enterprise software","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Discover how the Model Context Protocol (MCP) shifts enterprise software from generalist reasoning to specialist capability. Explore expert insights on maintaining compliance, scaling AI agents, and integrating domain-specific AI into your workflow.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-09-22T00:00-05:00","link":"/pl/blog/what-mcp-changes-about-enterprise-software","sourceType":"blog"},{"id":"blog-5g1BOvx4UriGh81tLNNg43","createdAt":"2026-09-22T03:17:26.011Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-22T03:17:26.011Z","title":"DeepL jest teraz dostępne w Microsoft Copilot, ChatGPT i Claude’u za pośrednictwem MCP","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Połącz DeepL z Microsoft Copilot, ChatGPT, Claude i innymi kompatybilnymi narzędziami, żeby tłumaczyć teksty i dokumenty bezpośrednio za pomocą DeepL","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-09-22T04:00+02:00","link":"/pl/blog/deepl-available-in-microsoft-copilot-chatgpt-claude-mcp","sourceType":"blog"},{"id":"blog-1feRaDLVNBsP7Bw5dh8cu4","createdAt":"2026-09-15T05:37:47.445Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-15T05:37:47.445Z","title":"DeepL Voice teraz zachowuje brzmienie Twojego głosu w czasie rzeczywistym niezależnie od języka","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Tłumaczenie mowy w czasie rzeczywistym teraz zachowuje ton i brzmienie głosu każdego rozmówcy w różnych językach, a wszystko to dzięki jednej aplikacji desktopowej obsługującej Zoom, Teams i Google Meet.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-09-15T08:00-04:00","link":"/pl/blog/deepl-voice-preserves-your-voice-across-languages","sourceType":"blog"},{"id":"ailabs-Tf75UAj5SWnfpt1e1rW0P","createdAt":"2026-08-20T04:23:43.350Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-20T04:23:43.350Z","title":"Warstwa audio live rewolucjonizująca tłumaczenie mowy","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Zobacz, jak DeepL Voice API łączy protokoły audio z modelami tłumaczenia end-to-end, zapewniając mowę na mowę z ultra niskim opóźnieniem.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-08-20T04:23:43.350Z","link":"/pl/ai-labs/real-time-audio-layer-transforming-voice-translation","sourceType":"aiLabs"},{"id":"ailabs-6qUCT8Vrhyv2Mo6IOkG7vE","createdAt":"2026-07-20T23:56:07.154Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-20T23:56:07.154Z","title":"Jak tworzymy system oceny jakości tłumaczeń dla DeepL","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Niezależne modele oceny wykrywają błędy w tłumaczeniach maszynowych, usprawniają pracę i zwiększają zaufanie do lokalizacji opartej na AI.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-07-20T23:56:07.154Z","link":"/pl/ai-labs/building-translation-quality-evaluation","sourceType":"aiLabs"},{"id":"ailabs-7n9gJDN02FQEzeEXsQXmqA","createdAt":"2026-06-21T21:56:12.896Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-21T21:56:12.896Z","title":"Od tłumaczeń po platformę głosową w czasie rzeczywistym","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Modele zamiany dźwięku na mowę minimalizują opóźnienia, uchwytują niuanse głosowe i oferują tłumaczenie w czasie rzeczywistym lepsze niż standardowe narzędzia.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-06-21T21:56:12.896Z","link":"/pl/ai-labs/high-quality-text-to-real-time-voice","sourceType":"aiLabs"}],"pt-BR":[{"id":"5OjIfi6FHdHGnmwy8XJEuC","createdAt":"2026-08-03T09:37:27.352Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-03T09:37:27.352Z","title":"DeepL para agentes de IA","description":{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Agora você pode usar o DeepL diretamente no Claude, no ChatGPT, no Microsoft Copilot e em qualquer agente compatível com MCP. Agora, seus agentes podem traduzir do jeito que sua empresa faz: com seus termos, seu tom e seus padrões de qualidade.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Os administradores podem ativar ou desativar o acesso nas configurações da organização.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"}],"nodeType":"document"},"publicationDate":"2026-07-15","link":"https://www.deepl.com/pt-BR/ai-agents","linkLabel":"Conheça o DeepL para agentes de IA","relatedContent":[{"metadata":{"tags":[],"concepts":[]},"sys":{"space":{"sys":{"type":"Link","linkType":"Space","id":"pplyeawnfzc7"}},"id":"4dEWf3690LvxYVkZEHToqt","type":"Entry","createdAt":"2026-07-15T10:55:54.203Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-24T12:53:59.842Z","environment":{"sys":{"id":"master","type":"Link","linkType":"Environment"}},"publishedVersion":132,"revision":21,"contentType":{"sys":{"type":"Link","linkType":"ContentType","id":"landingPage"}},"locale":"pt-BR"},"fields":{"title":"DeepL para agentes de IA: traduza onde quer que sua IA funcione","description":"Conecte o DeepL ao Claude, ChatGPT, Microsoft Copilot e qualquer cliente MCP — tradução, redação e a terminologia da sua empresa dentro dos seus agentes de IA.","urlPath":"ai-agents","urlPathVerification":"verified","publicationLocales":["ar","cs","de","en","es","fr","id","it","ja","ko","nl","pl","pt-BR","pt-PT","ru","sv","tr","uk","zh"],"dapPageId":1991,"pageOwner":"API","seoIndexation":true,"expandAllLinkCards":true,"header":[],"pageSections":[]}}],"sourceType":"notification"},{"id":"2TuRycS8zrSVTdPJh1MJX7","createdAt":"2026-07-07T12:00:16.677Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-08T15:21:02.536Z","title":"Translation Flow do DeepL: Novos fluxos de trabalho com IA para principais casos de uso e integrações","description":{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Translation Flow ganhou novas atualizações e integrações para dar suporte a casos de uso importantes, incluindo o Adobe Experience Manager e o InDesign para Marketing; o XLIFF para Treinamento e Desenvolvimento; e o SharePoint e o Google Drive para RH e outras áreas.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Otimize projetos multilíngues com fluxos de trabalho completos e focados em IA, e torne o Translation Flow acessível a ainda mais equipes funcionais da sua empresa.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"}],"nodeType":"document"},"publicationDate":"2026-07-07","link":"https://www.deepl.com/pt-BR/translation-flow","linkLabel":"Conheça o Translation Flow","sourceType":"notification"},{"id":"5HVK3MiQelBTMqYffAIY9t","createdAt":"2026-06-04T22:34:12.599Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-04T22:34:12.599Z","title":"The ROI of AI-native translation","description":{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Nucleus Research found enterprise teams can cut localization spend by 80-90%, and compress timelines from weeks to hours — without the quality tradeoffs of generic AI.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"}],"nodeType":"document"},"publicationDate":"2026-06-05","link":"https://www.deepl.com/en/reports/nucleus-roi-study","linkLabel":"Read the findings","sourceType":"notification"},{"id":"blog-66YKFU5PLiw3kthXLnhjVc","createdAt":"2026-09-22T03:23:18.386Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-22T03:23:18.386Z","title":"What MCP changes about enterprise software","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Discover how the Model Context Protocol (MCP) shifts enterprise software from generalist reasoning to specialist capability. Explore expert insights on maintaining compliance, scaling AI agents, and integrating domain-specific AI into your workflow.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-09-22T00:00-05:00","link":"/pt-BR/blog/what-mcp-changes-about-enterprise-software","sourceType":"blog"},{"id":"blog-5g1BOvx4UriGh81tLNNg43","createdAt":"2026-09-22T03:17:26.011Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-22T03:17:26.011Z","title":"O DeepL já está disponível no Microsoft Copilot, ChatGPT e Claude por meio do MCP","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Conecte o DeepL ao Microsoft Copilot, ChatGPT, Claude e outras ferramentas compatíveis para traduzir texto e documentos diretamente com o DeepL","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-09-22T04:00+02:00","link":"/pt-BR/blog/deepl-available-in-microsoft-copilot-chatgpt-claude-mcp","sourceType":"blog"},{"id":"blog-1feRaDLVNBsP7Bw5dh8cu4","createdAt":"2026-09-15T05:37:47.445Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-15T05:37:47.445Z","title":"O DeepL Voice agora mantém o tom da sua voz em tempo real, independentemente do idioma","description":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"A tradução de voz em tempo real agora mantém o tom e a voz de cada pessoa em todos os idiomas, com um aplicativo para desktop unificado para o Zoom, o Teams e o Google Meet.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"publicationDate":"2026-09-15T08:00-04:00","link":"/pt-BR/blog/